# Cursor AI Rule — Prefer Official NestJS Documentation

## Title
**Prefer Official NestJS Documentation**

## Rule
When providing answers, examples, or explanations related to **NestJS**, always consult and cite information from the official NestJS documentation at [https://docs.nestjs.com/](https://docs.nestjs.com/).

### Guidelines
- Prioritize official NestJS docs for API usage, architecture guidance, and best practices.
- Prefer code patterns and structure that match the official NestJS documentation style.
- If additional clarification is needed, use community NestJS knowledge only when not contradicted by the official documentation.
- If the official documentation does not explicitly answer the question, inform the user and then provide the best recommended approach based on established NestJS patterns.
- Avoid outdated NestJS patterns or deprecated API approaches.

### Goal
Ensure answers follow the current NestJS architecture, style guides, decorators, and module patterns as documented at [https://docs.nestjs.com/](https://docs.nestjs.com/).

### Reminder
> "Check https://docs.nestjs.com before answering."
